# How Netlify serves this repository. It builds nothing now (netlify.toml), so
# it publishes the root, and the root has no index.html: without these rules
# every path would 404.
#
# The last rule serves everything out of flow/. 200 = rewrite (the URL stays
# clean), and the ! forces it even where a root file exists, so the
# repository's own files - admin/, the documents, this file - are never served.
# flow/ also holds the generator, its content, its tools and the stylesheet
# sources, which the GitHub Pages workflow leaves out of what it publishes; the
# rules above the catch-all refuse them here too. A path they miss is still
# rewritten under flow/ first, so flow/content/products.json is reached as
# /content/..., which is refused, and never as /flow/content/....
# The admin, at bgscorner.com/admin. It is not a file and Netlify cannot run
# it: these two rules pass the request through to the machine that does, over
# the Cloudflare tunnel (200, a proxy, not a redirect, so the address stays the
# shop's). The tunnel presents this same hostname to the admin, and the admin's
# own address is set to it, so its cookie and its sign-in belong to
# bgscorner.com. Nothing is open by this: the admin asks Auth0 who you are and
# refuses anyone not on its list. With the machine off, this is a Cloudflare
# error instead of the admin.
/admin                   https://admin.bgscorner.com/admin           200
/admin/*                 https://admin.bgscorner.com/admin/:splat    200

# The cache worker, named on its own: the catch-all below reaches every other
# root file (robots.txt, favicon.ico, the pages), but Netlify answered /sw.js
# with a 404 through it, and the worker has to be at the root of the site to
# take charge of every page.
/sw.js                   /flow/sw.js     200!
# the same file under another name, to tell a host that reserves /sw.js
# from a rule that never arrived
/cache-worker.js         /flow/sw.js     200!
/build.py                /flow/404.html  404!
/server.py               /flow/404.html  404!
/edp_data.json           /flow/404.html  404!
/content/*               /flow/404.html  404!
/tools/*                 /flow/404.html  404!
/phone/*                 /flow/404.html  404!
/assets/flow.css         /flow/404.html  404!
/assets/cat/SOURCES.txt  /flow/404.html  404!
/*                       /flow/:splat    200!
